  ["Acquire 15 Winterspring Blood Samples and 20 gold and bring them along with a set of Wildheart Bracers to Deliana in Ironforge."] = "取得15滴冬泉血滴樣本，20金和1套野性之心護腕給鐵爐堡的德莉娜。",
  ["Acquire 4 Healthy Courser Glands and bring them to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath."] = "收集4份健康的野鹿腺體並把它們帶給艾薩拉的奧汀克。奧汀克住在埃達拉斯廢墟東北部懸崖的頂部。",
  ["Acquire an Ichor of Undeath for Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath."] = "為艾薩拉的奧汀克帶回1份亡靈腐液。奧汀克住在埃達拉斯廢墟東北部懸崖的頂端。",
  ["Acquire special horse feed used for feeding a spirit horse. Merideth Carlson in Southshore apparently is the source for such food.  Travel to the Dire Maul dungeon in Feralas and slay Tendris Warpwood. Doing so will free the Ancient Equine Spirit. Feed it the special horse feed, thereby soothing the spirit. Finally, give it the Arcanite Barding so it may bless it."] = "你需要特殊的飼料來餵養靈魂馬。南海鎮的梅麗德絲·卡爾森可以為你提供這樣的糧草。到菲拉斯的厄運之槌去，殺掉特迪斯·扭木，釋放上古聖馬之魂。用特殊的糧草餵養它，這樣可以安撫它的靈魂。最後，把奧金馬鎧交給它就可以完成祝福。",
  ["Acquire the reagents Ghak Healtouch needs from the Badlands, then return to him in Thelsamar."] = "從荒蕪之地拿到加克所需的材料，然後回到塞爾薩瑪去見他。",
