  ["Bring 1 pile of Kraul Guano to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity."] = "幫幽暗城的大藥劑師法拉尼爾帶回一堆沼澤蝙蝠的糞便。",
  ["Bring 10 Encoded Fragments to Archmage Xylem in Azshara."] = "將10片加密的碎片交給艾薩拉的大法師克希雷姆。",
  ["Bring 10 Glittering Dust to Archmage Xylem."] = "為大法師克希雷姆收集10份閃光粉末。",
  ["Bring 10 Rotting Wood and 4 Bloodvenom Essence to Impsy in Felwood."] = "將10塊腐爛的木頭和4個血毒精華交給費伍德森林的伊普斯。",
  ["Bring 10 Twilight Pendants to Argent Guard Manados in Darnassus."] = "收集10個暮光墜飾，把它們交給達納蘇斯的銀月守衛瑪納杜斯。",
  ["Bring 12 Essential Artificials to Klockmort Spannerspan in Ironforge."] = "收集12個基礎模組，把它們交給鐵爐堡的科勞莫特·鋼尺。",
  ["Bring 12 Magenta Fungus Caps to Ghak Healtouch in Thelsamar."] = "收集12顆紫色蘑菇，把它們交給塞爾薩瑪的加克。",
  ["Bring 12 Magenta Fungus Caps to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath."] = "收集12顆紫色蘑菇，把它們交給卡加斯的加卡爾。",
  ["Bring 15 Skeletal Fragments to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands."] = "將15塊骷髏碎片交給西瘟疫之地冰風崗的化學家阿爾比頓。",
  ["Bring 15 Skeletal Fragments to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."] = "將15塊骸骨碎片交給西瘟疫之地亡靈壁壘的藥劑師迪瑟斯。",
  ["Bring 20 Sapphires of Aku'Mai to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale."] = "收集20顆阿庫麥爾藍寶石，把它們交給梣谷的耶努薩克雷。",
  ["Bring 20 Vials of Troll Temper to Trenton Lighthammer in Gadgetzan."] = "收集20瓶食人妖調和劑，把它們交給加基森的特倫頓·輕錘。",
  ["Bring 30 bottles of Raging Beast's Blood to Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."] = "把30瓶狂暴野獸的血交給燃燒平原的莫蘇爾·召血者。",
  ["Bring 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 Rugged Leather, 2 Rune Threads, and Ogre Tannin to Knot Thimblejack. He is currently chained inside the Gordok wing of Dire Maul."] = "把4份符文布卷、8塊硬甲皮、2卷符文線和一份巨魔鞣酸交給諾特·希姆加克。他現在被拴在厄運之槌的戈多克巨魔那邊。",
  ["Bring 4 Carved Stone Urns to Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan."] = "收集4個雕紋石罐，把它們交給洛克莫丹的勘察員基恩薩·鐵環。",
  ["Bring 4 Gromsblood, 10 Giant Silver Veins and Nagmara's Filled Vial to Mistress Nagmara in Blackrock Depths."] = "將4份格羅姆之血、10塊巨型銀礦和裝滿水的娜瑪拉之瓶交給黑石深淵的娜瑪拉小姐。",
  ["Bring 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water vials, and 150 gold to Grimand Elmore in the Dwarven District of Stormwind."] = "把40塊符文布、6塊奧金錠、10份阿薩斯之淚、5瓶斯坦索姆聖水和150枚金幣交給暴風城矮人區的格瑞曼德·艾爾默。",
  ["Bring 5 Buzzard Gizzards, 10 Crag Coyote Fangs, and 5 Rock Elemental Shards to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath, Badlands."] = "前往荒蕪之地取回加卡爾需要的試劑，然後回到卡加斯把試劑交給他。",
  ["Bring 5 Uncracked Scarab Shells to Tran'rek in Gadgetzan."] = "帶5個完整的聖甲蟲殼給加基森的特蘭雷克。",
  ["Bring 6 Wavethrasher Scales to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath."] = "帶回6個碎浪多頭怪的鱗片給艾薩拉的奧汀克。奧汀克居住在埃達拉斯廢墟東北部的懸崖頂部。",
  ["Bring 6 portions of Wailing Essence to Mebok Mizzyrix in Ratchet."] = "收集6份哀嚎香精，把它們交給棘齒城的麥伯克·米希瑞克斯。",
  ["Bring 8 Altered Snapjaw Shells to Tonga Runetotem at the Crossroads."] = "收集8塊變異的鉗嘴龜殼，把它們交給十字路口的圖加。",
  ["Bring 8 Broodling Essence and the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 to Tinkee Steamboil at the Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes."] = "將龍靈採集器8型和900份雛龍精華交給燃燒平原烈焰峰的丁奇·斯迪波爾。",
  ["Bring 8 Collected Dragon Eggs and the Collectronic Module to Tinkee Steamboil at Flame Crest in the Burning Steppes."] = "將電動採集模組和8顆收集到的龍蛋交給燃燒平原烈焰峰的丁奇·斯迪波爾。",
  ["Bring 8 Dentrium Power Stones and 8 An'Alleum Power Stones to Rigglefuzz in the Badlands."] = "給荒蕪之地的里格弗茲帶去8塊德提亞姆能量石和8塊安納洛姆能量石。",
  ["Bring 8 Thorium Plated Daggers to Kalaran Windblade."] = "帶8把瑟銀匕首給卡拉然·風刃。",
  ["Bring 8 Uncracked Chillwind Horns to Felnok Steelspring."] = "將8支完整的冰風奇美拉角交給菲諾克。",
  ["Bring Ambassador Malcin's Head to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "把瑪克林大使的頭顱交給幽暗城的瓦里瑪薩斯。",
  ["Bring Back the Mug"] = "歸還酒杯",
  ["Bring Felnok's Package to Tinkee Steamboil in the Burning Steppes."] = "把菲諾克的包裹交給燃燒平原的丁奇·斯迪波爾。",
  ["Bring Foreman Thistlenettle's Explorers' League Badge to Wilder Thistlenettle in Stormwind."] = "將工頭希斯耐特的探險者協會徽章帶回去給暴風城的維爾德·希斯耐特。",
  ["Bring Fragments of Rok'Alim to Dorn Plainstalker in Thousand Needles."] = "把羅卡里姆的碎片交給千針石林的多恩·平原行者。",
  ["Bring Gahz'rilla's Electrified Scale to Wizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats."] = "把加茲瑞拉的鱗片交給閃光平原的維茲爾·銅栓。",
  ["Bring Grenka's Claw to Dorn Plainstalker in Thousand Needles."] = "把格林卡的爪子交給千針石林的多恩·平原行者。",
  ["Bring Lethtendris' Web to Latronicus Moonspear at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas."] = "把蕾瑟塔蒂絲的網交給菲拉斯羽月要塞的拉托尼庫斯·月矛。",
  ["Bring Lethtendris's Web to Talo Thornhoof at Camp Mojache in Feralas."] = "把蕾瑟塔蒂絲的網交給非拉斯莫沙徹營地的塔羅·刺蹄。",
  ["Bring Me His Head"] = "把他的頭帶來",
  ["Bring Nekrum's Medallion to Thadius Grimshade in the Blasted Lands."] = "將耐克魯姆的徽章交給詛咒之地的薩迪斯·格希德。",
  ["Bring Razorflank's Heart to Auld Stonespire in Thunder Bluff."] = "把卡爾加·刺肋的心臟交給雷霆崖的奧爾德·石塔。",
  ["Bring Razorflank's Medallion to Falfindel Waywarder in Thalanaar."] = "把卡爾加·刺肋的大獎章帶給薩蘭納爾的法芬德爾。",
  ["Bring Ribbly's Head to Yuka Screwspigot in the Burning Steppes."] = "把雷布里的頭顱交給燃燒平原的尤卡·斯庫比格特。",
  ["Bring Sharpbeak's Feather to Thadius Grimshade in the Blasted Lands."] = "將沙普比克的羽毛交給詛咒之地的薩迪斯·格希德。",
  ["Bring Techbot's Memory Core to Tinkmaster Overspark in Ironforge."] = "將尖端機器人的記憶體核心交給鐵爐堡的工匠大師歐沃斯巴克。",
  ["Bring a Lieutenant's Insignia to Thrall in Orgrimmar."] = "將軍官的徽章交給奧格瑪的索爾。",
  ["Bring a Prismatic Punch Card to Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge."] = "將彩色穿孔卡片交給鐵爐堡的大機械師卡斯派普。",
  ["Bring a Venom Bottle to an apothecary in Tarren Mill."] = "將毒藥瓶交給塔倫米爾的某個藥劑師。",
  ["Bring a Wildheart Belt and a set of Wildheart Gloves Deliana in Ironforge."] = "將野性之心腰帶，一套野性之心手套帶給鐵爐堡的德莉娜。",
  ["Bring a pair of Perfect Courser Antlers to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast of the Ruins of Eldarath."] = "將一副完好的苔蹄快步者鹿角交給艾薩拉的奧汀克。奧汀客居住在埃達拉斯廢墟東北部的懸崖頂。",
  ["Bring a piece of felcloth to Impsy in Felwood."] = "將1塊惡魔布交給費伍德森林的伊普斯。",
  ["Bring a total of 6 Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in sunken temple."] = "到沉沒的神廟去，從食人妖們身上獲取6枝巫毒羽毛。",
  ["Bring an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind."] = "把一塊艾澤拉斯鑽石和一塊原始黑鑽石交給暴風城教堂區的格雷森·沙東布瑞克公爵。",
  ["Bring an Infernal Orb to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh."] = "將一顆地獄火寶珠交給塵泥沼澤的塔貝薩。",
  ["Bring an Undamaged Venom Sac to Apothecary Lydon in Tarren Mill."] = "將完好無損的毒囊交給塔倫米爾的藥劑師林度恩。",
  ["Bring five silver bars to Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge."] = "給鐵爐堡的塔瓦斯德·基瑟爾帶去五塊銀錠。",
  ["Bring the Ancient Egg to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris."] = "將遠古之卵交給塔納利斯的葉基亞。",
  ["Bring the Atal'ai Tablet Fragment to Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind."] = "將阿塔萊石板碎片交給暴風城的布羅哈恩·鐵桶。",
  ["Bring the Book of Ur to Keeper Bel'dugur at the Apothecarium in the Undercity."] = "把烏爾之書拿給幽暗城煉金區裡的看守者貝爾杜加。",
  ["Bring the Bundle of Atal'ai Artifacts to the Atal'ai Exile in the Hinterlands."] = "將一包阿塔萊神器交給辛特蘭的阿塔萊流放者。",
  ["Bring the Case of Blood to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes."] = "把血箱交給燃燒平原的戈瑟奇·邪眼。",
  ["Bring the Damp Note to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale."] = "把潮濕的便箋交給梣谷的耶努薩克雷。",
  ["Bring the Darkstone Tablet to Shadow Mage Vivian Lagrave in Kargath."] = "將黑暗石板交給卡加斯的暗法師薇薇安·拉格雷。",
  ["Bring the Divino-matic Rod to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan."] = "把探水棒交給加基森的首席工程師沙克斯·比格維茲。",
  ["Bring the End"] = "寒冰之王",
  ["Bring the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer to Deliana in Ironforge."] = "將超空間靈體顯像機帶給鐵爐堡的德莉娜。",
  ["Bring the Fathom Core to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale."] = "把深淵之核交給梣谷左拉姆加前哨站裡的耶努薩克雷。",
  ["Bring the Fifth and Sixth Mosh'aru Tablets to Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris."] = "將第五塊和第六塊摩沙魯石板交給塔納利斯的勘查員詹斯·鐵靴。",
  ["Bring the Filled Egg of Hakkar to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris."] = "將裝滿的哈卡之卵交給塔納利斯的葉基亞。",
  ["Bring the First and Second Mosh'aru Tablets to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris."] = "將第一塊和第二塊摩沙魯石板交給塔納利斯的葉基亞。",
  ["Bring the Frozen Eggs to Betina Bigglezink."] = "將冰凍的龍蛋交給貝蒂娜·比格辛克。",
  ["Bring the Frozen Eggs to Leonid Barthalomew in the Eastern Plaguelands."] = "把冰凍的龍蛋交給東瘟疫之地的萊尼德·巴薩羅梅。",
  ["Bring the Gems of Cobrahn, Anacondra, Pythas and Serpentis to Nara Wildmane in Thunder Bluff."] = "將考布萊恩寶石、安娜科德拉寶石、皮薩斯寶石和瑟芬迪斯寶石交給雷霆崖的納拉·蠻鬃。",
  ["Bring the Healthy Dragon Scale to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands."] = "把健康的龍鱗交給東瘟疫之地聖光之願禮拜堂中的貝蒂娜·比格辛克。",
  ["Bring the Heart of the Mountain to Maxwort Uberglint in the Burning Steppes."] = "把山脈之心交給燃燒平原的麥克斯沃特·尤柏格林。",
  ["Bring the Imbued Skeletal Fragments and 15 gold coins to Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan."] = "把灌魔的骸骨碎片和15枚金幣交給加基森的克林科·古德斯迪爾。",
  ["Bring the Imp in a Jar to the alchemy lab in the Scholomance. After the parchment is created, return the jar to Gorzeeki Wildeyes."] = "把瓶中的小鬼帶到通靈學院的煉金實驗室中。在小鬼製造出羊皮紙之後，把瓶子還給戈瑟奇·邪眼。",
  ["Bring the Light"] = "與聖光同在",
  ["Bring the Lorgalis Manuscript to Gerrig Bonegrip in the Forlorn Cavern in Ironforge."] = "把洛迦里斯手稿帶給鐵爐堡的葛利·硬骨。",
  ["Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Ragnar Thunderbrew in Kharanos."] = "把遺失的雷酒秘方帶給卡拉諾斯的拉格納·雷酒。",
  ["Bring the Lost Thunderbrew Recipe to Vivian Lagrave in Kargath."] = "把遺失的雷酒秘方交給卡加斯的薇薇安·拉格雷。",
  ["Bring the Nightmare Shard to Hamuul Runetotem on Elder Rise."] = "把噩夢碎片交給長者高地的哈繆爾·符文圖騰。",
  ["Bring the Nightmare Shard to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in Darnassus."] = "把噩夢碎片交給達納蘇斯的瑪斯雷·馭熊者。",
  ["Bring the Sealed Blood Container to Mux Manascrambler inside Gadgetzan in Tanaris."] = "將密封的鮮血採樣瓶帶到塔納利斯的加基森，交給莫克斯·施法者。",
  ["Bring the Strange Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar Outpost, Ashenvale."] = "把奇怪的水球交給梣谷左拉姆加前哨站的耶努薩克雷。",
  ["Bring the Tablet of Ryun'eh to Theldurin the Lost."] = "把雷烏納石板帶給迷失者塞爾杜林。",
  ["Bring the Third and Fourth Mosh'aru Tablets to Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris."] = "把第三塊和第四塊摩沙魯石板交給塔納利斯的勘查員詹斯·鐵靴。",
  ["Bring the Tiara of the Deep to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh."] = "將深淵皇冠交給塵泥沼澤的塔貝薩。",
  ["Bring the Titan Relic to Muln Earthfury at the Skywatcher Plateau in northwest Mulgore."] = "將泰坦聖物帶去莫高雷西北方的天空守望者高原給穆倫‧地怒。",
  ["Bring the Tooth of Morphaz to Ogtinc in Azshara. Ogtinc resides atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath."] = "將摩弗拉斯的牙齒交給艾薩拉的奧汀克。他住在埃達拉斯廢墟東北部懸崖的頂端。",
  ["Bring the Voodoo Feathers from the trolls in the Sunken Temple to the Fallen Hero of the Horde."] = "將你從沉沒的神廟的食人妖身上得到的巫毒羽毛交給部落英雄的靈魂。",
  ["Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Varimathras in Undercity."] = "將《暗影法術研究》和《扭曲虛空的魔法》這兩本書交給幽暗城的瓦里瑪薩斯。",
  ["Bring the head of Targorr the Dread to Guard Berton in Lakeshire."] = "把塔高爾的頭顱帶給湖畔鎮的衛兵伯爾頓。",
  ["Bring the head of Twilight Lord Kelris to Bashana Runetotem in Thunder Bluff."] = "把夢遊者克爾里斯的頭顱交給雷霆崖的巴珊娜·符文圖騰。",
  ["Bring the head of Twilight Lord Kelris to Dawnwatcher Selgorm in Darnassus."] = "把夢遊者克爾里斯的頭顱交給達納蘇斯的哨兵塞爾高姆。",
  ["Bring twenty-four Robo-mechanical Guts to Shoni in Stormwind."] = "收集24副機械內膽，把它們交給暴風城的舒尼。",
