  ["Escort Belnistrasz to the Quilboar's idol in Razorfen Downs.  Protect Belnistrasz while he performs the ritual to shut down the idol."] = "護送貝尼斯特拉茲來到剃刀高地的野豬人神像處。當他在執行儀式封印石像時保護他。",
  ["Escort Kernobee to the Clockwerk Run exit and then report to Scooty in Booty Bay."] = "將克努比護送到發條小徑的出口，然後向藏寶海灣的斯庫提彙報。",
  ["Escort Willix the Importer out of Razorfen Kraul."] = "護送進口商威利克斯逃出剃刀沼澤。",
  ["Escort the Defias Traitor to the secret hideout of the Defias Brotherhood. Once the Defias Traitor shows you where VanCleef and his men are hiding out, return to Gryan Stoutmantle with the information."] = "護送迪菲亞叛徒前往迪菲亞兄弟會的秘密藏身處。一旦迪菲亞叛徒把你帶到范克里夫和他的手下的藏匿地點之後，儘快回去向格萊恩·斯托曼彙報相關資訊。",
  ["Escort your prisoner, Grark Lorkrub, through Burning Steppes and through Blackrock Mountain to the Searing Gorge.  You recall Lexlort mentioning that he would have his men waiting on the other side to take Grark into custody.  You will also be required to hand over your Thorium Shackles to Lexlort."] = "押送你的囚犯格拉克·洛克魯布。穿過燃燒平原和黑石山脈，一直走到灼熱峽谷。雷克斯洛特曾經告訴過你，他會讓他的人等在黑石山脈的另外一邊準備接收格拉克。另外，你還要把瑟銀鐐銬一併還給雷克斯洛特。",
