  ["Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.  Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge.  Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Talendria in Nijel's Point."] = "在瑪拉頓裡用天藍水瓶在橙色水晶池中裝滿水。在維利斯塔姆藤蔓上使用裝滿水的天藍水瓶，使墮落的諾克賽恩幼體出現。治療8株植物並殺死那些諾克賽恩幼體，然後向尼耶爾前哨站的塔琳德莉亞覆命。",
  ["Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.  Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge.  Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village."] = "在瑪拉頓裡用天藍水瓶在橙色水晶池中裝滿水。在維利斯塔姆藤蔓上使用裝滿水的天藍水瓶，使墮落的諾克賽恩幼體出現。治療8株植物並殺死那些諾克賽恩幼體，然後向葬影村的瓦克·戰痕覆命。",
