  ["Finbus Geargrind"] = "芬布斯",
  ["Find 3 Soran'ruk Fragments and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment and return them to Doan Karhan in the Barrens."] = "找到3塊索蘭魯克寶珠的碎片和1塊索蘭魯克寶珠的大碎片，把它們交給貧瘠之地的杜安·卡漢。",
  ["Find Advisor Belgrum and give him his note."] = "找到顧問貝爾格拉姆，把便箋交給他。",
  ["Find Agmond"] = "尋找阿戈莫德",
  ["Find Agmond."] = "尋找阿戈莫德",
  ["Find Ardin Grassman in the Excavation Sites."] = "在挖掘場尋找亞丁‧格拉斯曼",
  ["Find Baelog in Uldaman."] = "在奧達曼找到巴爾洛戈。",
  ["Find Bijou's Belongings and return them to her. Good luck!"] = "找到比修的裝置並且交還給她。祝你好運！",
  ["Find Bingles"] = "尋找賓格斯",
  ["Find Braug Dimspirit near the entrance to Talondeep Path in Stonetalon Mountains."] = "找到連接石爪山和梣谷的石爪小徑裡的布勞格·幽魂。",
  ["Find Commander Gor'shak in Blackrock Depths.  You recall that the crudely drawn picture of the orc included bars drawn over the portrait. Perhaps you should search for a prison of some sort."] = "在黑石深淵裡找到指揮官哥沙克。在那幅草圖上畫著的是一個鐵欄後面的獸人，也許你應該到某個類似監獄的地方去找找看。",
  ["Find Daphne Stilwell in Westfall."] = "在西部荒野找到達芙妮·斯迪威爾。",
  ["Find Doctor Theolen Krastinov inside the Scholomance. Destroy him, then burn the Remains of Eva Sarkhoff and the Remains of Lucien Sarkhoff. Return to Eva Sarkhoff when the task is complete."] = "在通靈學院中找到瑟爾林·卡斯迪諾夫教授。殺死他，並燒毀艾瓦·薩克霍夫和盧森·薩克霍夫的遺體。任務完成後就回到艾瓦·薩克霍夫那兒。",
  ["Find Duskwing and slay him. From the corpse, recover a Patch of Duskwing's Fur and return it to Nathanos Blightcaller.  It is said that Duskwing roams the countryside to the north of Marris Stead."] = "找到暗翼蝠並殺掉它。從屍體上取下一塊暗翼蝠的皮，並把它交給納薩諾斯·凋零者。據說暗翼蝠遊蕩在瑪瑞斯農場北面的荒原上。",
  ["Find Egan. You only know that he was last seen around Stratholme."] = "找到伊根。你只知道他在斯坦索姆附近。",
  ["Find Fras Siabi's smoke shop in Stratholme and recover a box of Siabi's Premium Tobacco. Return to Smokey LaRue when the job is done."] = "找到艾茲拉‧格里姆在斯坦索姆的煙草店，並從中找回一盒格里姆的特級煙草，把它交給煙鬼拉魯恩。",
  ["Find Hammertoe Grez in Uldaman."] = "在奧達曼找到鐵趾格雷茲。",
  ["Find Hammertoe's Amulet and return it to him in Uldaman."] = "找到鐵趾的護符，把它交給奧達曼的鐵趾。",
  ["Find Lord Incendius in Blackrock Depths and destroy him!"] = "在黑石深淵裡找到伊森迪奧斯，然後把他幹掉！",
  ["Find Magma Lord Bokk in the Burning Steppes, obtain his Magma Core and bring it to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan."] = "去燃燒平原找到麥格瑪·博克王，取得他的岩漿之核帶給在加基森的莫克斯·施法者。",
  ["Find Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris."] = "到塔納利斯找到瑪爾馮·瑞文斯克。",
  ["Find Myranda"] = "尋找米蘭達",
  ["Find OOX-09/HL!"] = "找到OOX-09/HL！",
  ["Find OOX-17/TN!"] = "尋找OOX-17/TN！",
  ["Find OOX-22/FE!"] = "尋找OOX-22/FE！",
  ["Find Parqual Fintallas in Undercity."] = "找到幽暗城的帕科瓦·芬塔拉斯。",
  ["Find Prospector Ryedol and let him know Hammertoe Grez is alive."] = "找到勘察員雷杜爾，告訴他鐵趾格雷茲還活著。",
  ["Find Ranshalla"] = "蘭莎爾拉",
  ["Find Ras Frostwhisper in the Scholomance. When you have found him, use the Soulbound Keepsake on his undead visage. Should you succeed in reverting him to a mortal, strike him down and recover the Human Head of Ras Frostwhisper. Take the head back to Magistrate Marduke."] = "在通靈學院裡找到萊斯·霜語。當你找到他之後，使用禁錮靈魂的遺物破除其亡靈的外殼。如果你成功地破除了他的不死之身，就殺掉他並拿到萊斯·霜語的頭顱。把那個頭顱交給馬杜克鎮長。",
  ["Find The Beginnings of the Undead Threat, and return it to Parqual Fintallas in Undercity."] = "找到《亡靈的起源》，把它交給幽暗城的帕科瓦·芬塔拉斯。",
  ["Find a clue as to the gems' whereabouts in the depths of Uldaman."] = "在奧達曼裡找尋寶石的線索。",
  ["Find and return Treshala's Pendant to Treshala Fallowbrook in Darnassus."] = "將塔莎拉的墜飾帶給達納蘇斯的塔莎拉·靜水。",
  ["Find and return a Symbol of Ragnaros to Kalaran Windblade."] = "找到一個拉格納羅斯符記，把它交給卡拉然·溫布雷。",
  ["Find and slay Golem Lord Argelmach. Return his head to Lotwil. You will also need to collect 10 Intact Elemental Cores from the Ragereaver Golems and Warbringer Constructs protecting Argelmach. You know this because you are psychic."] = "找到並殺掉傀儡統帥阿格曼奇，將他的頭交給魯特維爾。你還需要從守衛著阿格曼奇的狂怒傀儡和戰鬥傀儡身上收集10塊完整的元素核心。",
  ["Find someone who can translate the paladin's journal. The closest location that might have someone is Kargath, in the Badlands."] = "在荒蕪之地的卡加斯哨所裡尋找一個可以幫你翻譯聖騎士日記的人。",
  ["Find the Altar of Hakkar in the Sunken Temple in Swamp of Sorrows."] = "在悲傷沼澤的沉沒神廟中找到哈卡祭壇。",
  ["Find the Black Guard Swordsmith in Stratholme and destroy him. Recover the Insignia of the Black Guard and return to Seril Scourgebane."] = "在斯坦索姆找到黑衣守衛鑄劍師，然後殺死他。將黑色衛士徽記交給亡靈殺手瑟里爾。",
  ["Find the Deathstalker Adamant and Deathstalker Vincent."] = "找尋亡靈哨兵阿達曼和亡靈哨兵文森。",
  ["Find the Felvine in Dire Maul and acquire a shard from it. Chances are you'll only be able to procure one with the demise of Alzzin the Wildshaper. Use the Reliquary of Purity to securely seal the shard inside, and return it to Rabine Saturna in Nighthaven, Moonglade."] = "在厄運之槌中找到魔藤，然後從它上面採集一塊碎片。只有幹掉了奧茲恩之後，你才能進行採集工作。使用淨化之匣安全地封印碎片，然後將其交給月光林地永夜港的拉比恩·薩圖納。",
  ["Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul.  According to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings."] = "找到戈多克力量護手，並將它交給厄運之槌的克羅卡斯。根據克羅卡斯所說的，「傳說」自稱是王子的精靈托塞德林從一名戈多克巨魔手中偷走了那件神器。",
  ["Find the Gems"] = "尋找寶石",
  ["Find the Gems and Power Source"] = "尋找寶貝",
  ["Find the Legacy of the Aspects and return it to Braug Dimspirit near the entrance to Talondeep Path in Stonetalon Mountains."] = "找到《巨龍的遺產》，把它還給位於梣谷和石爪山之間的石爪小徑裡的布勞格·幽魂。",
  ["Find the Lost Guards"] = "失蹤的衛兵",
  ["Find the Shattered Hand"] = "尋找碎手氏族",
  ["Find the Tablet of Will, and return them to Advisor Belgrum in Ironforge."] = "找到意志石板，把它們交給鐵爐堡的顧問貝爾格拉姆。",
  ["Find the ruby, sapphire, and topaz that are scattered throughout Uldaman. Once acquired, contact Talvash del Kissel remotely by using the Phial of Scrying he previously gave you.  From the journal, you know... * The ruby has been stashed in a barricaded Shadowforge area. * The topaz has been hidden in an urn in one of the Trogg areas, near some Alliance dwarves.  * The sapphire has been claimed by Grimlok, the trogg leader."] = "在奧達曼尋找紅寶石、藍寶石和黃寶石的下落。找到它們之後，通過塔瓦斯德給你的占卜之瓶和他進行聯繫。",
  ["Find the three gemstones of command: The Gemstone of Smolderthorn, Gemstone of Spirestone, and Gemstone of Bloodaxe. Return them, along with the Unadorned Seal of Ascension, to Vaelan.  The Generals, as told to you by Vaelan, are: War Master Voone of the Smolderthorn; Highlord Omokk of the Spirestone; and Overlord Wyrmthalak of the Bloodaxe."] = "找到三塊命令寶石：燃棘寶鑽、尖石寶鑽和血斧寶鑽。把它們和原始晉升印章一起交給維埃蘭。可能攜帶者三塊寶石的將軍是：燃棘氏族的指揮官沃恩、尖石氏族的歐莫克大王，以及血斧氏族的維姆薩拉克。",
  ["Finding Tan'jani"] = "尋找譚加尼",
  ["Finding the Antidote"] = "尋找解毒劑",
  ["Finding the Shadowy Figure"] = "搜尋烏鴉嶺",
  ["Finding the Source"] = "究根問底",
