  ["Kilgar's Head"] = "基爾加的頭顱",
  ["Kill 10 Skeletal Flayers and 10 Slavering Ghouls in Sorrow Hill.  Return to Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands."] = "殺掉悔恨嶺中的10個骷髏剝皮者和10個被奴役的食屍鬼。然後向西瘟疫之地冰風崗的指揮官阿胥拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特覆命。",
  ["Kill 15 Enraged Apparitions, 10 Tormented Souls and put the spirit of Anvilmar to rest."] = "殺死15個狂怒的亡魂和10個痛苦的靈魂，讓安威瑪的靈魂能夠安息。",
  ["Kill 20 Plagued Hatchlings, then return to Betina Bigglezink at the Light's Hope Chapel."] = "殺掉20隻瘟疫幼龍，然後向聖光之願禮拜堂的貝蒂娜·比格辛克復命。",
  ["Kill 7 Helboar in the Blasted Lands and return to the Fallen Hero of the Horde."] = "在詛咒之地殺死7隻地獄野豬，然後回到部落英雄的靈魂那裡。",
  ["Kill 8 Razorfen Battleguard, 8 Razorfen Thornweavers, and 8 Death's Head Cultists and return to Myriam Moonsinger near the entrance to Razorfen Downs."] = "殺掉8個剃刀沼澤護衛者、8個剃刀沼澤織棘者和8個亡首教徒，然後向剃刀高地入口處的麥雷姆·月歌覆命。",
  ["Kill Ambassador Infernus in Angor Fortress and bring proof of his death to Advisor Belgrum in Ironforge."] = "殺死苦痛堡壘中的因弗努斯大使，把證明他已死亡的信物交給鐵爐堡的顧問貝爾格拉姆。",
  ["Kill Arugal and bring his head to Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher."] = "殺死阿魯高，把他的頭帶給瑟伯切爾的達拉爾·道恩維沃爾。",
  ["Kill Bazil Thredd and bring his head back to Warden Thelwater at the Stockade."] = "殺死巴基爾·斯瑞德，把他的頭帶給監獄的典獄官塞爾沃特。",
  ["Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar."] = "殺死巴札蘭和祈求者耶戈什，然後回到奧格瑪的索爾那裡。",
  ["Kill Edwin VanCleef and bring his head to Gryan Stoutmantle."] = "殺死艾德溫·范克里夫，把他的頭交給格萊恩·斯托曼。",
  ["Kill Grundig Darkcloud"] = "殺死格魯迪格·暗雲",
  ["Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore."] = "殺死大檢察官懷特邁恩，血色十字軍指揮官莫格萊尼，十字軍的勇士赫洛德和馴犬者洛克希並向南海鎮的萊雷恩覆命。",
  ["Kill High Inquisitor Whitemane, Scarlet Commander Mograine, Herod, the Scarlet Champion and Houndmaster Loksey and then report back to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "殺掉大檢察官懷特邁恩、血色十字軍指揮官莫格萊尼、血色十字軍勇士赫洛德和馴犬者洛克希，然後向幽暗城的瓦里瑪薩斯回報。",
  ["Kill Lorgus Jett in Blackfathom Deeps and then return to Je'neu Sancrea in Ashenvale."] = "殺掉黑澗深淵裡的洛古斯·傑特，然後回來找梣谷的耶努薩克雷。",
  ["Kill Morphaz in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar, and return his blood to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. The entrance to the sunken temple can be found in the Swamp of Sorrows."] = "前往沉沒的神廟阿塔哈卡，殺死摩弗拉斯，將他的血液交給費伍德森林中的格雷塔·苔蹄。沉沒的神廟的入口就在悲傷沼澤。",
  ["Kill Rath'mael in the Ruins of Lordaeron for Deathguard Kristof in Brill."] = "為布瑞爾的亡靈衛兵克里斯多夫殺死羅德隆廢墟的拉斯梅爾。",
  ["Kill the Demon of the Orb, then speak with Tabetha."] = "殺死寶珠之魔，然後與塔貝薩談話。",
