  ["Recover 10 Plagued Flesh Samples from Stratholme and return them to Betina Bigglezink. You suspect that any creature in Stratholme would have said flesh sample."] = "從斯坦索姆找回10個瘟疫肉塊，並把它們交給貝蒂娜·比格辛克。你覺得斯坦索姆中的生物都不大可能長著肉。",
  ["Recover all three gems and a power source for the necklace from Uldaman, and then bring them to Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath. Jarkal believes a power source might be found on the strongest construct present in Uldaman.  From the journal, you know... * The ruby has been stashed in a barricaded Shadowforge area. * The topaz has been hidden in an urn in one of the Trogg areas, near some Alliance dwarves. * The sapphire has been claimed by Grimlok, the trogg leader."] = "從奧達曼找回項鏈上的所有三塊寶石和能量源，然後把它們交給卡加斯的加卡爾。紅寶石被藏在暗影矮人層層設防的地區。黃寶石藏在石齶怪活動地區的一個甕中。藍寶石在格瑞姆洛克手中，他是石齶怪的領袖。能量源可能在奧達曼的某個最強生物的手中。",
  ["Recover an Ancient Gurubashi Idol from the Drowned City."] = "從沉沒之城取回遠古古拉巴什塑像。",
  ["Recover the Key!"] = "找回鑰匙！",
  ["Recover the two parts of the Scepter of Celebras: the Celebrian Rod and the Celebrian Diamond.  Find a way to speak with Celebras."] = "找回塞雷布拉斯節杖的兩個部分：塞雷布拉斯魔棒和塞雷布拉斯鑽石。然後設法和塞雷布拉斯對話。",
