  ["Retrieve 4 Miners' Union Cards and return them to Wilder Thistlenettle in Stormwind."] = "找回4張礦業工會會員卡並送回給暴風城的維爾德·薊草。",
  ["Retrieve Mythology of the Titans from the Monastery and bring it to Librarian Mae Paledust in Ironforge."] = "從修道院拿回《泰坦神話》，把它交給鐵爐堡的圖書館員麥伊·蒼塵。",
  ["Retrieve a Putrid Vine from the guardian at the bottom of the Sunken Temple and return to Torwa Pathfinder."] = "前往沉沒的神廟底部，從守衛那取回腐爛的藤蔓並交給托爾瓦·尋路者。",
  ["Retrieve an Obsidian Power Source and bring it to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh."] = "找到一個黑曜石能量源，將其交給塵泥沼澤的塔貝薩。",
  ["Retrieve the Arcane Shard from Morphaz and return to Archmage Xylem."] = "從摩弗拉斯身上取回祕法碎片並返回大法師克希雷姆那兒。",
  ["Retrieve the Compendium of the Fallen from the Monastery in Tirisfal Glades and return to Sage Truthseeker in Thunder Bluff."] = "從血色修道院裡找到《墮落者綱要》，把它交給雷霆崖的聖者圖希克。",
  ["Retrieve the Gnoam Sprecklesprocket from the Deadmines and return it to Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind."] = "從死亡礦坑中帶回小型高能發動機，將其帶給暴風城矮人區中的沉默的舒尼。",
  ["Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar."] = "從諾姆瑞根拿到鑽探設備藍圖和機電師的保險箱密碼，把它們交給奧格瑪的諾格。",
  ["Retrieve the Sealed Azure Bag from the Timbermaw Shaman in Azshara. Then take the bag to Archmage Xylem, also found in Azshara."] = "從艾薩拉的木喉薩滿那兒取回密封的藍袋子，將它交給艾薩拉的大法師克希雷姆。",
  ["Retrieve the Stone Circle from Marvon Rivetseeker's workshop in Ratchet."] = "到棘齒城去，從瑪爾馮·瑞文斯克的車間裡取回石環。",
  ["Rettrick"] = "雷崔克",
  ["Return 4 Thicket Raptor Hides to James Halloran, the tanner, in Menethil Harbor."] = "將4張灌木迅猛龍皮帶回去給米奈希爾港的皮匠詹姆士‧哈洛倫。",
  ["Return Foror's Compendium of Dragon Slaying to the Athenaeum."] = "將《弗洛爾的屠龍技術綱要》還回圖書館。",
  ["Return Marshal Windsor's Lost Information.  Marshal Windsor believes that the information is being held by Golem Lord Argelmach and General Angerforge."] = "找回溫德索爾元帥遺失的情報。溫德索爾元帥確信那些情報在安格弗將軍和傀儡元帥阿格曼奇的手裡。",
  ["Return Trip"] = "回程",
