  ["Search Dire Maul for Kariel Winthalus. Report back to Sage Korolusk at Camp Mojache with whatever information that you may find."] = "到厄運之槌去尋找卡里爾·溫薩魯斯。向莫沙徹營地的先知科魯拉克報告你所找到的資訊。",
  ["Search Dire Maul for Kariel Winthalus. Report back to Scholar Runethorn at Feathermoon with whatever information that you may find."] = "到厄運之槌去尋找卡里爾·溫薩魯斯。向羽月要塞的學者盧索恩·紋角報告你所找到的資訊。",
  ["Search More Hovels"] = "搜尋雕像",
  ["Search Orgrimmar for Ragefire Chasm, then kill 8 Ragefire Troggs and 8 Ragefire Shaman before returning to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff."] = "在奧格瑪找到怒焰裂谷，殺掉8個怒焰穴居人和8個怒焰薩滿，然後向雷霆崖的拉哈羅覆命。",
  ["Search Ragefire Chasm for Maur Grimtotem's corpse and search it for any items of interest."] = "在怒焰裂谷搜尋瑪爾·恐怖圖騰的屍體以及他留下的東西。",
  ["Search for Incendicite"] = "火岩礦石",
  ["Search for Tyranis"] = "尋找泰拉尼斯",
  ["Search for an imp inside a cave at the entrance of Darkwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, purchase a Fel Elemental Rod and return to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan."] = "前往冬泉谷南方的暗語峽谷入口，向住在洞穴裡的小鬼買下一把惡魔元素魔棒，再回到加基森的莫克斯·施法者那裡。",
  ["Search for clues as to the current disposition of Talvash's necklace within Uldaman. The slain paladin he mentioned was the person who had it last."] = "去奧達曼尋找塔瓦斯的魔法項鏈，被殺的聖騎士是最後一個拿著它的人。",
