  ["Seek out Argent Guard Thaelrid in Blackfathom Deeps."] = "到黑色深淵去找到銀月守衛塞爾瑞德。",
  ["Seek out Commander Ashlam Valorfist. His base camp is located at Chillwind Camp, north of the Alterac Mountains."] = "找到指揮官阿胥拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特。他的大本營位於奧特蘭克山脈以北的冰風崗。",
  ["Seek out High Executor Derrington. His base camp is located at the Bulwark, east of Tirisfal Glade and the Undercity."] = "找到高級執行官德靈頓。他將自己的大本營建在提里斯法林地和幽暗城以東的亡靈壁壘。",
  ["Seek out Ogtinc in Azshara."] = "尋找艾薩拉的奧汀克。",
  ["Seek out Remulos in Moonglade and give him the Seed of Life."] = "到月光林地去找到雷姆洛斯，將生命之種交給他。",
  ["Seek out Rexxar. The Warchief has instructed you as to his whereabouts. Search the paths of Desolace, between the Stonetalon Mountains and Feralas."] = "按照酋長的指示找到雷克薩。他在石爪山和菲拉斯之間的淒涼之地遊蕩。",
  ["Seek out Rhapsody Shindigger in The Hinterlands."] = "去辛特蘭找到拉普索迪·鐵鏟。",
  ["Seek out SI: 7"] = "軍情七處",
  ["Seek out Sanath Lim-yo and gain passage to see Archmage Xylem."] = "尋找薩納斯並獲得見到大法師克希雷姆的通路。",
  ["Seek out the Carrion Grubs and Devourers of the region. Slay them and harvest their meat. Return to Tirion Fordring when you have gathered 15 Slabs of Carrion Worm Meat."] = "在東瘟疫之地搜索腐肉蟲和腐肉吞噬者。殺了它們並收集它們的肉。當你收集到15塊食腐蟲肉塊之後，就回到提里恩·弗丁那裡。",
