  ["Slavering Ghoul"] = "被奴役的食屍鬼",
  ["Slavering Worg"] = "被奴役的座狼",
  ["Slay 15 Black Broodlings, 10 Black Dragonspawn, 4 Black Wyrmkin and 1 Black Drake. Return to Helendis Riverhorn when the task is complete."] = "殺掉15條黑色小龍、10條黑色龍人和1條黑色幼龍。當你完成任務之後就向赫林迪斯·河角回報。",
  ["Slay 20 Plaguehound Runts, 5 Plaguehounds and 5 Frenzied Plaguehounds. Return to Tirion Fordring when the task is complete."] = "殺掉20條瘟疫幼犬、5條瘟疫犬和5條狂怒的瘟疫犬。任務完成之後向提里恩·弗丁覆命。",
  ["Slay 30 Plaguebats and return to Tirion Fordring."] = "殺死30隻瘟疫蝙蝠，然後向提里恩·弗丁覆命。",
  ["Slay Agmond's killer, Murdaloc.  Slay 12 Stonevault Bonesnappers.  Report to Prospector Ironband in Loch Modan."] = "幹掉殺害阿戈莫德的兇手：莫達洛克。順便殺掉12個石窟斷骨者。然後向洛克莫丹的勘察員基恩薩·鐵環報告。",
  ["Slay Emperor Dagran Thaurissan and free Princess Moira Bronzebeard from his evil spell."] = "殺掉達格蘭·索瑞森大帝，然後將鐵爐堡公主茉艾拉·銅鬚從他的邪惡詛咒中拯救出來。",
  ["Slay Fineous Darkvire and recover the great hammer, Ironfel. Take Ironfel to the Shrine of Thaurissan and place it on the statue of Franclorn Forgewright."] = "殺掉弗諾斯·達克維爾並拿回戰錘鐵膽。把鐵膽之錘拿到索瑞森神殿去，將其放在弗蘭克羅恩·鑄鐵的雕像上。",
  ["Slay Halycon, pack mistress of the Bloodaxe worg."] = "殺死血斧座狼的領袖，哈雷肯。",
  ["Slay Highlord Omokk, War Master Voone, and Overlord Wyrmthalak. Recover Important Blackrock Documents. Return to Warlord Goretooth in Kargath when the mission has been accomplished."] = "殺死歐莫克大王、指揮官沃恩和維姆薩拉克。找到重要的黑石文件，然後向卡加斯的軍官高圖斯彙報。",
  ["Slay Overmaster Pyron and return to Jalinda Sprig.  You recall Jalinda talking about Pyron guarding the quarry. Perhaps you should search there?"] = "殺掉征服者派隆，然後向加琳達覆命。加琳達告訴過你，派隆守在採礦場中，也許你應該去那裡找找。",
  ["Slay Princess Theradras and return to Keeper Marandis at Nijel's Point in Desolace."] = "殺死瑟萊德絲公主，然後回到淒涼之地尼耶爾前哨站的守護者瑪蘭迪斯那裡覆命。",
  ["Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace."] = "殺死瑟萊德絲公主，然後回到淒涼之地葬影村附近的瑟琳德拉那裡覆命。",
  ["Slay the Dragonmaw forces within the Excavation Site and return to the Deathstalker Agent outside with anything you recover."] = "殺死挖掘場內的龍喉部族勢力，然後帶著你找到的任何東西回去找亡靈哨兵密探。",
