  ["Speak with Dillinger"] = "迪林格爾",
  ["Speak with Eitrigg in Orgrimmar. When you have discussed matters with Eitrigg, seek council from Thrall.  You recall having seen Eitrigg in Thrall's chamber."] = "和奧格瑪的伊崔格談話。討論完畢後，諮詢索爾的意見。你回憶起曾在索爾的大廳中見過伊崔格。",
  ["Speak with Franclorn Forgewright if you are interested in obtaining a key to the city major."] = "如果你想要得到進入這座城市主城區的鑰匙，就去和弗蘭克羅恩·鑄鐵談話。",
  ["Speak with Gramma"] = "跟湯米的祖母談話",
  ["Speak with Grimand Elmore in Stormwind's Dwarven District."] = "與暴風城矮人區的格瑞曼德·艾爾默談話。",
  ["Speak with Gryphon Master Talonaxe inside the Aerie Peak Aviary."] = "與辛特蘭的鷹巢山獅鷲獸飼養場裡的獅鷲獸管理員沙拉克·鷹斧談話。",
  ["Speak with Hamuul Runetotem."] = "和哈繆爾·符文圖騰談話。",
  ["Speak with High Thane Falstad Wildhammer at Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands."] = "到辛特蘭的鷹巢山找男爵族長弗斯塔德·蠻錘。",
  ["Speak with Highlord Bolvar Fordragon after speaking with Lady Katrana Prestor."] = "與女伯爵卡特拉娜·普瑞斯托談話，然後再與伯瓦爾·弗塔根公爵談話。",
  ["Speak with Jennea"] = "和詹妮亞交談",
  ["Speak with Kharan Mighthammer and gather information about Princess Moira Bronzebeard's kidnapping. Take that information to Thrall in Orgrimmar.  You recall Gor'shak mentioning that Kharan is being held in a cell nearby."] = "與卡蘭·巨錘談一談，收集關於綁架公主鐵爐堡公主茉艾拉·銅鬚這一事件的情報。將情報回饋給奧格瑪城裡的索爾。哥沙克提到過卡蘭被關在附近的某個牢房中。",
  ["Speak with Klockmort Spannerspan in Ironforge."] = "與鐵爐堡的科勞莫特·鋼尺談話。",
  ["Speak with Latronicus Moonspear at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas."] = "和菲拉斯羽月要塞的拉托尼庫斯·月矛談話。",
  ["Speak with Lorax. Listen to what he has to say."] = "與羅拉克斯談話，聽聽他說了什麼。",
  ["Speak with Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District."] = "與暴風城教堂區的格雷森·沙東布瑞克公爵談話。",
  ["Speak with Lord Jorach Ravenholdt in Ravenholdt Manor."] = "和拉文霍德莊園的喬拉齊·拉文霍德公爵談一談。",
  ["Speak with Marshal Maxwell in the Burning Steppes."] = "和燃燒平原的麥克斯韋爾元帥談話。",
  ["Speak with Master Gadrin in Sen'jin Village."] = "與森金村的加德林大師談話。",
  ["Speak with Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge."] = "與鐵爐堡的大機械師卡斯派普談話。",
  ["Speak with Mor'zul Bloodbringer in the Burning Steppes."] = "與燃燒平原的莫蘇爾·召血者談話。",
  ["Speak with Nara Wildmane."] = "和納拉·蠻鬃談話。",
  ["Speak with Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos."] = "與卡拉諾斯的奧齊·電環談話。",
  ["Speak with Prospector Ironband at Ironband's Excavation Site in Loch Modan."] = "和洛克莫丹鐵環挖掘場的勘察員基恩薩·鐵環談話。",
  ["Speak with Prospector Stonehewer"] = "勘查員塔雷·石鎬",
  ["Speak with Ragged John to learn of Marshal Windsor's fate and return to Marshal Maxwell when you have completed this task.  You recall Marshal Maxwell telling you to search for him in a cave to the north."] = "和狼狽不堪的約翰談談來瞭解溫德索爾元帥的命運，然後回到麥克斯韋爾元帥那裡。你想起麥克斯韋爾元帥說過他在一個北面的洞穴那裡。",
  ["Speak with Ragnar Thunderbrew."] = "和拉格納·雷酒談談。",
