  ["Take Bolvar's Decree to Magistrate Solomon in Lakeshire."] = "把伯瓦爾的命令交給湖畔鎮的所羅門鎮長。",
  ["Take Brother Anton's Letter of Commendation to Raleigh the Devout in Southshore."] = "將安東修士的表彰信帶給南海鎮的虔誠的萊雷恩。",
  ["Take Five Bases"] = "奪取五座基地",
  ["Take Four Bases"] = "奪取四座基地",
  ["Take General Drakkisath's Command to Marshal Maxwell in Burning Steppes."] = "把達基薩斯將軍的命令交給燃燒平原的麥克斯韋爾元帥。",
  ["Take Hammertoe's Amulet to Historian Karnik in Ironforge."] = "把鐵趾的護符交給鐵爐堡的史學家卡尼克。",
  ["Take Hammertoe's Amulet to Prospector Ryedol in the Badlands."] = "把鐵趾的護符交給荒蕪之地的勘察員雷杜恩。",
  ["Take Shaw's report to Gryan Stoutmantle in Westfall."] = "將肖爾的報告交給西部荒野的格萊恩·斯托曼。",
  ["Take Two With Water"] = "配水服用兩顆",
  ["Take Wiley's Note to Gryan Stoutmantle in Westfall."] = "將威利的字條交給西部荒野的格萊恩·斯托曼。",
  ["Take Wiley's Note to Mathias Shaw in Stormwind."] = "將威利的字條交給暴風城的馬迪亞斯·肖爾。",
  ["Take the Elemental Shard Sample to Lotwil Veriatus.  You recall Theodora saying that Lotwil was stationed in a camp to the east."] = "將元素碎片樣本交給魯特維爾·沃拉圖斯。塞朵拉說魯特維爾就在東邊的一處營地裡。",
  ["Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff."] = "將恐怖圖騰背包交給雷霆崖的拉哈羅。",
  ["Take the Head of Balnazzar to Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff in the Eastern Plaguelands."] = "將巴納札爾的頭顱交給東瘟疫之地的尼古拉斯·瑟倫霍夫公爵。",
  ["Take the Head of Onyxia to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind."] = "將奧妮克希亞的頭顱交給暴風城的伯瓦爾·弗塔根公爵。",
  ["Take the Head of Onyxia to Thrall in Orgrimmar."] = "將奧妮克希亞的頭顱交給奧格瑪的索爾。",
  ["Take the Lieutenant's Insignia to Neeru Fireblade and speak to him. Gauge if he believes you are a member of the Burning Blade and then return to Thrall in Orgrimmar."] = "將軍官的徽章交給尼爾魯·燃刃並與他談話，看看他是否相信你是燃刃氏族中的一員，然後回到奧格瑪的索爾那裡。",
  ["Take the Skeleton Key Mold and 2 Thorium Bars to the top of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater. Use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key.  Bring the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Alchemist Arbington at Chillwind Point, Western Plaguelands."] = "把骷髏鑰匙模具和2塊瑟銀錠帶到安戈洛環形山地區的火羽山頂部。在熔岩湖旁使用骷髏鑰匙模具，鑄造出一把未完工的骷髏鑰匙。把未完工的骷髏鑰匙交給西瘟疫之地冰風崗的化學家阿爾比頓。",
  ["Take the Skeleton Key Mold and 2 Thorium Bars to the top of Fire Plume Ridge in Un'Goro Crater. Use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake to forge the Unfinished Skeleton Key.  Bring the Unfinished Skeleton Key to Apothecary Dithers at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."] = "把骷髏鑰匙模具和2塊瑟銀錠帶到安戈洛環形山地區的火羽山頂部。在熔岩湖旁使用骷髏鑰匙模具，鑄造出一把未完工的骷髏鑰匙。把未完工的骷髏鑰匙交給西瘟疫之地亡靈壁壘的藥劑師迪瑟斯。",
  ["Take the Small Scroll to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "把小卷軸交給幽暗城的瓦里瑪薩斯。",
  ["Take the Soulbound Keepsake to Leonid Barthalomew in Eastern Plaguelands."] = "把禁錮靈魂的遺物交給東瘟疫之地的萊尼德·巴薩羅梅。",
  ["Take the Torch of Retribution."] = "拿起懲戒火炬。",
