  ["Travel into the Sunken Temple and discover the secret hidden in the circle of statues."] = "去沉沒的神廟，找出雕像群中隱藏的秘密。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Depths and find Kharan Mighthammer.  The King mentioned that Kharan was being held prisoner there - perhaps you should try looking for a prison."] = "去黑石深淵找到卡蘭·巨錘。國王提到卡蘭在那裡負責看守囚犯——也許你應該在監獄附近尋找他。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 10 Essence of the Elements. Your first inclination is to search the golems and golem makers. You remember Vivian Lagrave also muttering something about elementals."] = "到黑石深淵去取得10份元素精華。你應該在那些作戰傀儡和傀儡製造者身上找找，另外，薇薇安·拉格雷也提到了一些有關元素生物的話題。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Depths and recover 20 Dark Iron Fanny Packs. Return to Oralius when you have completed this task. You assume that the Dark Iron dwarves inside Blackrock Depths carry these 'fanny pack' contraptions."] = "到黑石深淵去找到20個黑鐵挎包。當你完成任務之後，回到奧拉留斯那裡覆命。你認為黑石深淵裡的黑鐵矮人應該會有這些黑鐵挎包。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Depths and slay Bael'Gar.  You only know that the giant resides inside Blackrock Depths. Remember to use the Altered Black Dragonflight Molt on Bael'Gar's remains to capture the Fiery Essence.  Return the Encased Fiery Essence to Cyrus Therepentous."] = "到黑石深淵去殺掉貝爾加。你只知道這個巨型怪物住在黑石深淵的最深處。記住你要使用特殊的黑龍皮從貝爾加的屍體上採集烈焰精華。將你採集到的烈焰精華交給塞勒斯·薩雷芬圖斯。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Depths and slay General Angerforge! Return to Warlord Goretooth when the task is complete."] = "到黑石深淵去殺掉安格弗將軍！當任務完成之後向軍官高圖斯覆命。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Mountain in the northwest and enter Blackrock Depths. Find out what became of Marshal Windsor.  You recall Ragged John talking about Windsor being dragged off to a prison."] = "到西北部的黑石山脈去，在黑石深淵中找到溫德索爾元帥的下落。狼狽不堪的約翰曾告訴你說溫德索爾被關進了一個監獄。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 15 Spire Spider Eggs for Kibler.  By the sound of it, these eggs could be found near spiders."] = "到黑石塔去為基布雷爾收集15枚尖塔蜘蛛卵。聽說那些蜘蛛周圍有許多這樣的卵。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Spire and collect 20 Black Dragonspawn Eyes. Return to Myranda the Hag when the task is complete."] = "到黑石塔去收集20顆黑色龍人的眼球，完成任務之後回到巫女米蘭達那裡。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy General Drakkisath. Return to Marshal Maxwell when the job is done."] = "去黑石塔殺掉達基薩斯將軍。當任務完成之後回去找麥斯威爾指揮官。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg."] = "到黑石塔去摧毀那裡的座狼源頭。當你離開的時候，赫林迪斯喊出了一個名字：哈雷肯。這個詞就是獸人語中「座狼」的意思。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Bloodaxe Worg Pups. Use the cage to carry the ferocious little beasts. Bring back a Caged Worg Pup to Kibler."] = "到黑石塔去找到小血斧座狼。使用籠子來捕捉這些兇猛的小野獸，然後把籠中的小座狼交給基布雷爾。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Spire and find Goraluk Anvilcrack. Slay him and then use the Blood Stained Pike upon his corpse. After his soul has been siphoned, the pike will be Soul Stained.  You must also find the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate.  Return both the Soul Stained Pike and the Unforged Rune Covered Breastplate to Lorax in Winterspring."] = "到黑石塔去找到古拉魯克。殺死他，然後用血污長矛刺入他的屍體。當他的靈魂被吸幹後，這支矛就會成為穿魂長矛。你還必須找到未鑄造的符文覆飾胸甲。將穿魂長矛和未鑄造的符文覆飾胸甲都交給冬泉谷的羅拉克斯。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Spire and find out what happened to Bijou."] = "到黑石塔去查明比修的下落。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay General Drakkisath. Gather his blood and return it to Rexxar."] = "到黑石塔去殺掉達基薩斯將軍，把它的血交給雷克薩。",
  ["Travel to Blackrock Spire and slay Warchief Rend Blackhand. Take his head and return to Orgrimmar."] = "去黑石塔殺死大酋長雷德·黑手，帶著他的頭顱返回奧格瑪。",
  ["Travel to Dire Maul and locate the Imp, Pusillin. Convince Pusillin to give you Azj'Tordin's Book of Incantations through any means necessary.  Return to Azj'Tordin at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas should you recover the Book of Incantations."] = "到厄運之槌去找到小鬼普希林。你可以使用任何手段從小鬼那裡得到埃斯托爾迪的咒術之書。找到咒術之書後，回到拉瑞斯小亭的埃斯托爾迪那裡。",
  ["Travel to Gershala Nightwhisper in Auberdine."] = "到奧伯丁的戈沙拉·夜語那兒去。",
  ["Travel to Gnomeregan and bring back High Potency Radioactive Fallout. Be warned, the fallout is unstable and will collapse rather quickly.  Ozzie will also require your Heavy Leaden Collection Phial when the task is complete."] = "到諾姆瑞根去收集高強度輻射塵。要多加小心，這種輻射塵非常不穩定，很快就會分解。奧齊要求你在任務完成後把沉重的鉛瓶也交給他。",
  ["Travel to Grim Batol and track down Axtroz, drake champion of the Red Flight. Destroy him and take his skull. Return the skull to Emberstrife."] = "到格瑞姆巴托去殺掉紅龍埃克托茲，把他的顱骨交給艾博斯塔夫。",
  ["Travel to Ironforge and get High Priest Rohan's Exorcism Censer. You will need to make a donation of 150 gold in order to secure it."] = "到鐵爐堡去找高階牧師洛漢，從他那裡拿到驅魔香爐。你需要捐贈150金幣來獲得它。",
  ["Travel to Lakeshire and deliver Helendis Riverhorn's Letter to Magistrate Solomon."] = "把赫林迪斯·河角的信交給湖畔鎮的所羅門鎮長。",
  ["Travel to Light's Hope in Eastern Plaguelands and seek out Leonid Barthalomew the Revered. Show him the Keepsake of Remembrance and tell him all that you have discovered."] = "到東瘟疫之地的聖光之願禮拜堂去找到萊尼德·巴薩羅梅，給他看看巫妖生前的遺物，並告訴他你收集到的情報。",
  ["Travel to Northdale, in the northeastern region of the Eastern Plaguelands, and recover the Symbol of Lost Honor. Return to Tirion Fordring upon completion of your objective."] = "到東瘟疫之地東北部的北谷去，找到失落榮耀的象徵。完成目標之後向提里恩·弗丁覆命。",
  ["Travel to Ratchet to find someone that can tell you more about the glowing shard.  Then, deliver the shard as you are directed."] = "前往棘齒城尋找一個人，他能告訴你更多關於發光碎片的事。然後，將碎片送往被指示的地方。",
  ["Travel to Silithus and search for a Reliquary of Purity within the ruins of Southwind Village. If you are able to find it, return with it to Rabine Saturna in Nighthaven, Moonglade."] = "到希利蘇斯的南風村去尋找淨化之匣。然後將其交給月光林地永夜港的拉比恩·薩圖納。",
  ["Travel to Stormwind City and venture to the city gates. Speak with Squire Rowe so that he may let Marshal Windsor know that you have arrived."] = "前往暴風城的城門。和侍衛洛義談談，這樣他就會讓溫德索爾元帥知道你已抵達了。",
  ["Travel to Stormwind and deliver Solomon's Plea to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon.  Bolvar resides in Stormwind Keep."] = "到暴風城去把所羅門的求援信交給伯瓦爾·弗塔根公爵。伯瓦爾在暴風要塞裡。",
  ["Travel to Stratholme and find Archivist Galford of the Scarlet Crusade. Destroy him and burn down the Scarlet Archive."] = "在斯坦索姆城中找到血色十字軍的文件管理員加爾福特，殺掉他，然後燒毀血色十字軍文獻。",
  ["Travel to Stratholme and find Menethil's Gift. Place the Keepsake of Remembrance upon the unholy ground."] = "到斯坦索姆城裡去找到米奈希爾的禮物，把巫妖生前的遺物放在那塊邪惡的土地上。",
  ["Travel to Stratholme and kill the Crimson Hammersmith. Recover the Crimson Hammersmith's Apron and return to Lilith."] = "到斯坦索姆去殺死紅衣鑄錘師。將紅衣鑄錘師的圍裙交給莉莉絲。",
  ["Travel to Stratholme and search the ziggurats. Find and return new Scourge Data to Betina Bigglezink."] = "到斯坦索姆去探索那裡的通靈塔。找到新的天譴軍團檔案，把它交給貝蒂娜·比格辛克。",
  ["Travel to Stratholme and slay Ramstein the Gorger. Take his head as a souvenir for Nathanos."] = "到斯坦索姆去，殺掉吞嚥者拉姆斯登。把他的頭顱交給納薩諾斯。",
  ["Travel to Stratholme, in the north. Search the supply crates that litter the city and recover 5 Stratholme Holy Water. Return to Leonid Barthalomew the Revered when you have collected enough of the blessed fluid."] = "到北方的斯坦索姆去，尋找散落在城市中的補給箱，並收集5瓶斯坦索姆聖水。當你找到足夠的聖水之後就回去向萊尼德·巴薩羅梅覆命。",
  ["Travel to Stratholme, in the northern part of the Plaguelands. It is in the Scarlet Bastion that you will find the painting 'Of Love and Family,' hidden behind another painting depicting the twin moons of our world.  Return the painting to Tirion Fordring."] = "到瘟疫之地北部的斯坦索姆去。你可以在血色十字軍堡壘中找到「愛與家庭」這幅畫，它被隱藏在另一幅描繪兩個月亮的畫之後。把這幅畫還給提里恩·弗丁。",
  ["Travel to Winterspring and find Haleh. Give her Awbee's scale."] = "到冬泉谷去找到哈爾琳，把奧比的鱗片交給她。",
  ["Travel to island of Caer Darrow, in the south-central region of the Plaguelands, and look for any clues as to the whereabouts of the painting."] = "到凱爾達隆島去，尋找關於那副畫的線索。凱爾達隆島在瘟疫之地南部的湖中央。",
  ["Travel to the Arathi Highlands, to the ruins of Stromgarde. Search Stromgarde for a Keepsake of Remembrance. If you find such an item, return with it to Magistrate Marduke."] = "到阿拉希高地的激流堡遺跡裡面尋找巫妖生前的遺物。如果你能找到這樣的東西，就把它交給馬杜克鎮長。",
  ["Travel to the Burning Steppes and find Grark Lorkrub. You recall Lexlort mentioning that he was last seen in a massive Blackrock fortress.  When you find Grark Lorkrub, use the Thorium Shackles to bind him and then lead him back through Blackrock Mountain to the Searing Gorge. Lexlort will have his men waiting on the other side to take Grark into custody."] = "到燃燒平原去找到格拉克·洛克魯布。你回憶起雷克斯洛特曾經提起過，格拉克應該是在一座大型的黑石要塞中。當你找到格拉克·洛克魯布之後，用瑟銀鐐銬把他銬起來，然後將其帶回灼熱峽谷。雷克斯洛特會讓他的部下等在那裡接應你。",
  ["Travel to the Undercroft - at the southernmost section of the Eastern Plaguelands - and recover Taelan's Hammer. Return to Tirion Fordring upon completion of your objective."] = "到東瘟疫之地最南端的墓室去找回泰蘭之錘。完成目標之後，返回提里恩·弗丁那裡。",
  ["Travel to the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul and slay the water elemental, Hydrospawn. Return to Lorekeeper Lydros in the Athenaeum with the Hydrospawn Essence."] = "到厄運之槌的扭木廣場去殺掉水元素海多斯博恩。把海多斯博恩精華交給圖書館的博學者萊德羅斯。",
  ["Travel to the Wetlands and meet the Deathstalker Agent in the hills above the Dragonmaw camp."] = "前往濕地，並在龍喉營地上方的山丘與亡靈哨兵密探會合。",
  ["Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh and seek out Emberstrife's Den. Once inside, wear the Amulet of Draconic Subversion and speak with Emberstrife."] = "去塵泥沼澤中的巨龍沼澤，找到艾博斯塔夫的洞穴。進入洞穴後帶上龍形護符，跟艾博斯塔夫交談。",
  ["Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh. Find the ancient drake, Emberstrife and beat him without mercy until his will is broken.  It is at that moment which you must place the Unforged Seal of Ascension before the great beast. You must then be quick to use the Orb of Draconic Energy on his weakened form and claim dominion over his mental faculties. Control the beast and force the Flames of the Black Dragonflight upon the Unforged Seal of Ascension!"] = "到塵泥沼澤中的巨龍沼澤去。找到上古老龍艾博斯塔夫，對他發起無情的攻擊，直到他的意志被摧毀。此時，你必須儘快將未鑄造的晉升印章放在這條龍面前，並使用龍力寶珠控制他的軀體，強迫他將黑龍的烈焰噴向未鑄造的晉升印章！",
  ["Travel to the northern borders of the Eastern Plaguelands and recover the Quel'Thalas Registry. The item is somewhere in the Quel'Lithien lodge.  You must also slay 8 Rangers, 8 Pathstriders, and 8 Woodsmen."] = "到東瘟疫之地的北方邊界去找回奎爾薩拉斯名冊，這件物品在奎爾林斯小屋的某處。另外你還必須殺掉8個遊俠、8個巡路者和8個護林者。",
  ["Travel to the quarry in Blackrock Mountain and slay Overmaster Pyron. Return to Thunderheart when you have completed this assignment."] = "到黑石山脈的採石場去幹掉征服者派隆，然後向桑德哈特回報。",
