  ["Use Egan's Blaster on the ghostly and spectral citizens of Stratholme. When the restless souls break free from their ghostly shells, use the blaster again - freedom will be theirs!  Free 15 Restless Souls and return to Egan."] = "對斯坦索姆的鬼魂使用伊根的衝擊器。當那些永不安息的靈魂掙脫他們的外殼時，再次使用伊根的衝擊器——他們就可以獲得自由了！解放15個永不安息的靈魂，然後回到伊根那裡去。",
  ["Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth spirits you must fight. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver; defeat him.  Bring Darkreaver's Head to Sagorne Creststrider in the Valley of Wisdom, Orgrimmar."] = "在斯坦索姆地下室的屍骨儲藏所的中心使用預言水晶球。然後你必須與被召喚出來的幽靈作戰。擊敗這些幽靈之後，死亡騎士達克雷爾才會出現，你的任務就是擊敗他。把死亡騎士達克雷爾的頭顱交給奧格瑪智慧穀的薩格尼。",
  ["Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth the spirits you must judge. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver. Defeat him and reclaim the lost soul of the fallen charger.  Give the Charger's Redeemed Soul and the Blessed Enchanted Barding to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger."] = "在通靈學院屍骨儲藏所地下室的中心使用預言水晶球。將你要審判的靈魂引領出來。將這些靈魂擊敗然後死亡騎士達克雷爾就將被召喚出來。將其擊敗然後獲得墮落戰馬的靈魂。把贖罪的戰馬之魂和受祝福的奧金馬鎧一起附在達克雷爾的墮落戰馬身上。",
  ["Use the Ectoplasmic Distiller near incorporeal undead to collect 12 Scorched Ectoplasms in Silithus, 12 Frozen Ectoplasms in Winterspring and 12 Stable Ectoplasms in the Eastern Plaguelands. Bring them along with the Ectoplasmic Distiller back to Mux Manascrambler in Gadgetzan."] = "前往東瘟疫之地，在無形的不死族附近使用外膜蒸餾器收集12個希利蘇斯燒焦的外膜、12個冬泉谷冰凍的外膜和12個東瘟疫之地穩定的外膜。將它們和外膜蒸餾器一起交給在加基森的莫克斯·施法者。",
  ["Use the Eggscilloscope Prototype on an egg in the Rookery."] = "在孵化間對著某顆龍蛋使用龍蛋冷凍器初號機。",
  ["Use the Empty Leaden Collection Phial on Irradiated Invaders or Irradiated Pillagers to collect radioactive fallout. Once it is full, take it back to Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos."] = "用空鉛瓶對著輻射入侵者或者輻射搶劫者，從它們身上收集放射塵。瓶子裝滿之後，把它交給卡拉諾斯的奧齊·電環。",
  ["Use the Exorcism Censer to drive out the spirits that torment Terrordale. When you have slain 25 Terrordale Spirits, return to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind."] = "使用驅魔香爐召喚恐懼谷中的靈魂。當你殺掉25個恐懼谷的靈魂之後，回到暴風城教堂區的格雷森·沙東布瑞克公爵那裡覆命。",
  ["Use the Extra-Dimensional Ghost Revealer at the entrance to Stratholme and speak with the ghost of Anthion Harmon."] = "在斯坦索姆的入口使用超空間靈體顯像機並和安希恩·哈莫的鬼魂談談。",
  ["Use the Well Water Sample Kit to collect samples from the wells at the Jansen Stead and the Molsen Farm."] = "使用井水取樣工具組從傑生農場和摩爾森農場的水井取樣。",
  ["Used Monster Sample"] = "使用過的怪物樣本",
  ["Ushalac the Gloomdweller"] = "烏什拉克",
  ["Using Jordan's Weapon Notes, find some Whitestone Oak Lumber, Bailor's Refined Ore Shipment, Jordan's Smithing Hammer, and a Kor Gem, and return them to Jordan Stilwell in Ironforge."] = "按照喬丹的武器材料單上的說明去尋找一些白石橡木、精煉礦石、喬丹的鐵錘和一塊科爾寶石，然後回到鐵爐堡去見喬丹·斯迪威爾。",
  ["Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.  Once all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to Commander Ashlam Valorfist in Chillwind Camp, Western Plaguelands."] = "使用信號火炬為安多哈爾城中的四座哨塔做上標記，你必須站在哨塔門口才能成功地進行標記。在做完了標記之後，將信號火炬還給西瘟疫之地冰風崗的指揮官阿胥拉姆·瓦羅菲斯特。",
  ["Using the Beacon Torch, mark each tower in Andorhal; you will need to stand in the doorway of the tower to successfully mark it.  Once all four towers are marked, return the Beacon Torch to High Executor Derrington at the Bulwark, Western Plaguelands."] = "使用信號火炬為安多哈爾城中的四座哨塔做上標記，你必須站在哨塔門口才能成功地進行標記。在做完了標記之後，將信號火炬還給西瘟疫之地亡靈壁壘的高級執行官德靈頓。",
